# JNLisp CFD Native Display Package

- Author: Jed Nelson  
- Date: 27/11/25

Native visualization for domains, meshes, and solution fields using Ebitengine.

j(ns jnl.cfd.nativedisp)


## Display functions

Shows a domain in the viewer window.
j(defn show-domain
  ([domain] (.show-domain domain 800 600))
  ([domain width height] (.show-domain domain width height)))

Shows a mesh in the viewer window.
j(defn show-mesh
  ([mesh] (.show-mesh mesh 800 600))
  ([mesh width height] (.show-mesh mesh width height)))

Shows a solution field on the mesh with colormap.
j(defn show-solution
  ([mesh field] (.show-solution mesh field 800 600))
  ([mesh field width height] (.show-solution mesh field width height)))

Clears the viewer to blank screen.
j(defn clear-viewer []
  (.clear-viewer))

View any geometry or field object.
j(defn view 
  ([obj] (view obj 800 600))
  ([obj width height]
    (cond
      (domain? obj) (show-domain obj width height)
      (mesh? obj) (show-mesh obj width height)
      (field? obj) (throw (ex-info "view requires mesh for field visualization"))
      :else (throw (ex-info "Cannot view object")))))

View field on mesh.
j(defn view-field
  ([mesh field] (show-solution mesh field 800 600))
  ([mesh field width height] (show-solution mesh field width height)))
